  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-sector integrated humanitarian programme to address protection risks in Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">6-month country-wide integrated emergency programme with a cross-sector protection focus. Identified activities include: Protection Targeted Individual Assistance (TIA), Non-Food Item (NFI) distribution for health (including Psyco-Social Support) and winterization, Gender-Based Violence (GBV) programming &#x2013; training on GBV and clinical care for sexual assault survivors (CCSAS), and cash assistance - including both targeted GBV Individual Protection Assistance, Cash for Work (CfW) and Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance (MPCA).</narrative>
  </description>
